p>Gudslip® glasses are primarily non-prescription. However, you can opt to fit them with prescription lenses at a specialized eyewear store or check our product line for prescription-compatible models.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLfaSZQKyf_text","label":"ggLfaSZQKyf_text","default":"<p>For smudges and fingerprints, use a lens cleaner or a small amount of mild soap and water, and dry them gently with a microfiber cloth that is included in the purchase.</p>"}],
